    "Le notifiche di Forma sono spente: il promemoria non può arrivare. Attivale in Impostazioni → Notifiche → Forma.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifications for Forma are off, so the reminder can't arrive. Turn them on in Settings → Notifications → Forma."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifications for Forma are off, so the reminder can't arrive. Turn them on in Settings → Notifications → Forma."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le serie di questo allenamento non vengono salvate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sets from this workout won't be saved."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sets from this workout won't be saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le serie di questo esercizio non vengono salvate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sets from this exercise won't be saved."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sets from this exercise won't be saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le serie senza spunta non vengono salvate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sets without a checkmark won't be saved."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sets without a checkmark won't be saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le sessioni di palestra registrate sul Watch entrano da sole in Forma, con una notifica per aggiungere esercizi e pesi. Camminate, corsa, bici e nuoto di almeno %lld minuti diventano cardio. Forma legge da Salute, non scrive niente.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gym sessions recorded on your Watch come into Forma by themselves, with a notification to add exercises and weights. Walks, runs, rides and swims of at least %lld minutes become cardio. Forma reads from Health and doesn't write anything."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gym sessions recorded on your Watch come into Forma by themselves, with a notification to add exercises and weights. Walks, runs, rides and swims of at least %lld minutes become cardio. Forma reads from Health and doesn't write anything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le settimane A e B si alternano da sole. Il piano dice in Oggi se è giorno di pesi, cardio o riposo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weeks A and B alternate on their own. Today shows whether it's a weights, cardio or rest day."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weeks A and B alternate on their own. Today shows whether it's a weights, cardio or rest day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le spunte restano per questa settimana e la prossima.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checkmarks stay for this week and next week."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checkmarks stay for this week and next week."
          }
        }
      }
    },
